---
// CreatorStudio.astro - Feature 7: Creator Scriptwriter & Fullscreen Teleprompter
---
<div class="hud-panel hud-corner creator-studio-card">
  <div class="studio-header">
    <div>
      <div class="studio-title-row">
        <span class="badge badge-pantone-2021">CREATOR PRODUCTION SUITE</span>
        <h3 class="font-mono studio-heading">SCRIPTWRITER & TACTICAL TELEPROMPTER</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono text-muted" style="font-size: 0.76rem;">B-roll cue insertion, automated words-per-minute pacing estimator & mirror-mode teleprompter.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Live Teleprompter Trigger Button -->
    <button class="btn-tactical btn-primary font-mono" id="launchTeleprompterBtn">
      <span>▶ LAUNCH TELEPROMPTER</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="studio-grid">
    <!-- Script Editor Column -->
    <div class="editor-column hud-panel">
      <!-- Toolbar & B-Roll Insert Buttons -->
      <div class="editor-toolbar font-mono">
        <span class="toolbar-label">INSERT B-ROLL CUES:</span>
        <button class="cue-btn" data-cue="[MAP ZOOM: HORMUZ]">+ Map Chokepoint</button>
        <button class="cue-btn" data-cue="[ROLL SATELLITE PASS]">+ Satellite Pass</button>
        <button class="cue-btn" data-cue="[SPEC OVERLAY: ISKANDER-M]">+ Missile Spec</button>
        <button class="cue-btn" data-cue="[GRAPH: OIL SPIKE]">+ Oil Graph</button>
        <button class="cue-btn" data-cue="[SFX: SONAR PING]">+ Sonar SFX</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Editor Textarea -->
      <textarea id="scriptTextarea" class="script-textarea font-mono" placeholder="Write your geopolitical or military video essay script here...

[MAP ZOOM: TAIWAN STRAIT]
Today, we are analyzing the exact operational timeline of a naval blockade in the First Island Chain..."></textarea>

      <!-- Bottom Pacing Bar -->
      <div class="editor-footer font-mono">
        <div class="stat-pills">
          <span class="pill"><strong id="wordCount">0</strong> WORDS</span>
          <span class="pill"><strong id="charCount">0</strong> CHARS</span>
          <span class="pill" style="color: var(--primary);"><strong id="runtimeEst">0m 00s</strong> EST. RUNTIME</span>
        </div>
        <div class="wpm-control">
          <span>PACING:</span>
          <select id="wpmSelect" class="wpm-select">
            <option value="130">130 WPM (Documentary)</option>
            <option value="150" selected>150 WPM (Standard Essay)</option>
            <option value="175">175 WPM (Fast Paced)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Creator Quick Reference & Template Drawer -->
    <div class="reference-column hud-panel">
      <div class="ref-head font-mono">
        <span class="badge badge-pantone-2023">ESSAY STRUCTURE</span>
        <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-dim);">PROVEN 4-PART GEOPOLITICS RETENTION FORMULA</span>
      </div>

      <div class="formula-steps font-mono">
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num" style="color: #BB2649;">01. THE HOOK (0:00 - 1:15)</span>
          <p class="step-desc">Establish immediate strategic stakes. Cite the specific chokepoint or missile flight time that threatens global equilibrium.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num" style="color: #FFBE98;">02. THE DOCTRINE & SPECS (1:15 - 5:30)</span>
          <p class="step-desc">Break down the hardware (VLS cell counts, radar cross section, hypersonic kinetics). Show the numbers nobody else noticed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num" style="color: #6667AB;">03. THE WARGAME SCENARIO (5:30 - 10:00)</span>
          <p class="step-desc">Walk through the Herman Kahn escalation ladder. If Country A blockades Chokepoint B, what is the exact kinetic response?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num" style="color: #F5DF4D;">04. THE VERDICT & MACRO IMPACT (10:00 - 13:00)</span>
          <p class="step-desc">Connect the military clash to commodity prices, semiconductor supply chains, or the reshaped world order.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-tactical btn-outline font-mono full-w" id="loadTemplateBtn" style="font-size: 0.76rem;">
        Load 'Iskander Hypersonic Escalation' Starter Script
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FULLSCREEN TELEPROMPTER OVERLAY -->
  <div class="teleprompter-overlay" id="teleprompterOverlay" style="display: none;">
    <div class="teleprompter-hud font-mono">
      <div class="tp-controls">
        <button id="tpPlayPauseBtn" class="tp-btn">▶ PLAY (SPACE)</button>
        <button id="tpResetBtn" class="tp-btn">⏮ TOP</button>
        <div class="tp-speed">
          <span>SPEED:</span>
          <input type="range" id="tpSpeedSlider" min="1" max="10" value="3" />
          <span id="tpSpeedVal">3x</span>
        </div>
        <button id="tpMirrorBtn" class="tp-btn">🪞 MIRROR MODE</button>
        <button id="tpCloseBtn" class="tp-btn tp-close">✕ EXIT</button>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-marker-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="teleprompter-scroll-container" id="tpScrollContainer">
      <div class="teleprompter-text font-mono" id="tpText">
        <!-- Script text injected here -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script is:inline>
  const sampleScript = `[MAP ZOOM: TAIWAN STRAIT]
[SFX: SONAR PING]
For forty years, naval strategists believed that an aircraft carrier strike group was invulnerable to anything short of a nuclear attack.

[ROLL SATELLITE PASS: YAOGAN-33 SAR]
Today, that certainty has evaporated. 
Floating 600 kilometers in Low Earth Orbit, Synthetic Aperture Radar satellites are tracking carrier surface wakes in real-time, feeding high-precision fire-control coordinates down to mobile rocket batteries on the mainland.

[SPEC OVERLAY: ISKANDER-M / DF-21D]
At Mach 10, a maneuverable re-entry vehicle covers 1,500 kilometers in under eleven minutes. When it enters terminal dive mode, the defending warship's Aegis SPY-6 radar has fewer than 45 seconds to cue an SM-6 interceptor.

[GRAPH: CHOKEPOINT OIL SPIKE]
And if just one commercial vessel is hit in the strait, maritime container insurance rates skyrocket by 300 percent overnight. 

In this video, we're dissecting the exact mechanics of modern precision-strike doctrine...`;

  const textarea = document.getElementById('scriptTextarea');

  // Load from local storage or set sample
  const savedScript = localStorage.getItem('iskander_creator_script');
  if (savedScript) {
    textarea.value = savedScript;
  } else {
    textarea.value = sampleScript;
  }

  function updateScriptStats() {
    const text = textarea.value;
    localStorage.setItem('iskander_creator_script', text);

    const words = text.trim() ? text.trim().split(/\s+/).length : 0;
    const chars = text.length;
    document.getElementById('wordCount').innerText = words;
    document.getElementById('charCount').innerText = chars;

    const wpm = parseInt(document.getElementById('wpmSelect').value, 10);
    const totalSeconds = Math.round((words / wpm) * 60);
    const mins = Math.floor(totalSeconds / 60);
    const secs = totalSeconds % 60;
    document.getElementById('runtimeEst').innerText = `${mins}m ${secs < 10 ? '0' : ''}${secs}s`;
  }

  textarea.addEventListener('input', updateScriptStats);
  document.getElementById('wpmSelect')?.addEventListener('change', updateScriptStats);
  updateScriptStats();

  // B-Roll insert buttons
  document.querySelectorAll('.cue-btn').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const cue = '\n' + btn.getAttribute('data-cue') + '\n';
      const pos = textarea.selectionStart;
      textarea.value = textarea.value.substring(0, pos) + cue + textarea.value.substring(pos);
      updateScriptStats();
      textarea.focus();
    });
  });

  // Load template
  document.getElementById('loadTemplateBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    textarea.value = sampleScript;
    updateScriptStats();
  });

  // Teleprompter Logic
  const overlay = document.getElementById('teleprompterOverlay');
  const scrollContainer = document.getElementById('tpScrollContainer');
  const tpText = document.getElementById('tpText');
  let isScrolling = false;
  let scrollSpeed = 3;
  let scrollAnimId = null;

  document.getElementById('launchTeleprompterBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    tpText.innerText = textarea.value || "Please write a script first!";
    overlay.style.display = 'block';
    isScrolling = false;
    document.getElementById('tpPlayPauseBtn').innerText = '▶ PLAY (SPACE)';
  });

  document.getElementById('tpCloseBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    overlay.style.display = 'none';
    isScrolling = false;
    cancelAnimationFrame(scrollAnimId);
  });

  document.getElementById('tpResetBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    scrollContainer.scrollTop = 0;
  });

  function togglePlay() {
    isScrolling = !isScrolling;
    document.getElementById('tpPlayPauseBtn').innerText = isScrolling ? '⏸ PAUSE (SPACE)' : '▶ PLAY (SPACE)';
    if (isScrolling) {
      stepScroll();
    } else {
      cancelAnimationFrame(scrollAnimId);
    }
  }

  document.getElementById('tpPlayPauseBtn')?.addEventListener('click', togglePlay);

  function stepScroll() {
    if (!isScrolling) return;
    scrollContainer.scrollTop += scrollSpeed * 0.7;
    scrollAnimId = requestAnimationFrame(stepScroll);
  }

  document.getElementById('tpSpeedSlider')?.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
    scrollSpeed = parseInt(e.target.value, 10);
    document.getElementById('tpSpeedVal').innerText = `${scrollSpeed}x`;
  });

  document.getElementById('tpMirrorBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    tpText.classList.toggle('mirrored');
  });

  // Spacebar hotkey
  window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (overlay.style.display === 'block' && e.code === 'Space') {
      e.preventDefault();
      togglePlay();
    }
  });
</script>

<style>
  .creator-studio-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .studio-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.15);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .studio-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .studio-heading {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .studio-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .editor-column {
    background: rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.95);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .editor-toolbar {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    background: rgba(8, 11, 15, 0.8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .toolbar-label {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cue-btn {
    background: rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.2);
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .cue-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(var(--primary-rgb), 0.15);
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }

  .script-textarea {
    width: 100%;
    height: 340px;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    padding: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    resize: vertical;
    outline: none;
  }

  .editor-footer {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    background: rgba(8, 11, 15, 0.8);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stat-pills {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .pill {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .wpm-control {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .wpm-select {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    color: var(--text-main);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-family: monospace;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .reference-column {
    background: rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.95);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .ref-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.15);
  }

  .formula-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .step-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.12);
  }

  .step-num {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.35;
    font-family: sans-serif;
  }

  .full-w {
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* TELEPROMPTER OVERLAY */
  .teleprompter-overlay {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    background: #000000;
    z-index: 99999;
  }

  .teleprompter-hud {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    background: rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.95);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary);
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .tp-controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tp-btn {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--primary);
    color: var(--primary);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-family: monospace;
    font-weight: 800;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .tp-btn:hover {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #000000;
  }
  .tp-close {
    border-color: #BB2649;
    color: #FF6685;
  }

  .tp-speed {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .teleprompter-scroll-container {
    height: 100vh;
    overflow-y: scroll;
    padding: 140px 15% 300px;
  }

  .teleprompter-text {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    line-height: 1.8;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .teleprompter-text.mirrored {
    transform: scaleX(-1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .studio-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
